      "side": 1,
      "message": "It implies this file is included only.\n\nI don\u0027t want to add another \u0027.c\u0027 file for the symbol reset_flag_descs.\nsystem.c/system.o is manually designed as a build target in many build.mk, and I don\u0027t want them to add another build target, e.g. system_flag.o, just for the symbol in the build.mk.\nUsing \u0027.inc\u0027 could be easier to maintain the symbol sharing across host ectool and device system runtime IMO.",
